@inject Microsoft.Extensions.Options.IOptions<StoreOptions> Options
@{
    var store = Options.Value;
    ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy policy";
}

<p>This policy explains what personal information @store.LegalName ("we") collects when you use this website, and how we use it.</p>

<h2>What we collect</h2>
<ul>
    <li><strong>Contact details:</strong> your name, email address and, if you give it, your phone number.</li>
    <li><strong>Shipping address</strong> for delivering your orders.</li>
    <li><strong>Order and subscription history:</strong> what you bought, when, and your subscription settings.</li>
    <li>
        <strong>Payment information:</strong> payments are processed by PayPal. We never see or store your full card
        number. For subscriptions, PayPal gives us a reference to your saved payment method so we can charge renewals.
    </li>
    <li><strong>Messages</strong> you send us.</li>
</ul>

<h2>How we use it</h2>
<ul>
    <li>To process, ship and support your orders.</li>
    <li>To charge subscription renewals and send renewal reminders and receipts.</li>
    <li>To send you emails about your orders, subscription and account, such as sign-in links.</li>
    <li>To prevent fraud and meet our legal, tax and accounting obligations.</li>
</ul>
<p>We don't send marketing emails without your permission.</p>

<h2>Who we share it with</h2>
<p>We share only what each service needs to do its job:</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>PayPal</strong>, to process payments and refunds.</li>
    <li><strong>Our fulfilment partners</strong>, who pack and ship your orders, and the order system that passes orders to them (your name, email and shipping address, and what you ordered).</li>
    <li><strong>USPS</strong> or other carriers, to deliver your order.</li>
    <li><strong>Our email provider</strong>, to send you emails.</li>
    <li>Authorities, when the law requires it.</li>
</ul>
<p>We don't sell your personal information or share it for advertising.</p>

<h2>Cookies</h2>
<p>
    We use only the cookies the site needs to work: one to remember your cart, one to keep you signed in, and one that
    protects forms from misuse. We don't use advertising or tracking cookies.
</p>

<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
<p>
    We keep order records for as long as tax and accounting rules require, usually 7 years. Other information is kept
    while you have an active account or subscription, and deleted on request where we're not required to keep it.
</p>

<h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
<p>
    You can ask us to show you, correct or delete the personal information we hold about you, and depending on where you
    live you may have further rights, such as those under California law. Email @store.ContactEmail and we'll respond
    within 30 days. We won't treat you differently for making a request.
</p>

<h2>Security</h2>
<p>
    We protect your information with encrypted connections, restricted access and by never storing card numbers. No
    system is perfectly secure, but we work to keep your information safe.
</p>

<h2>Children</h2>
<p>Our products are for adults. We don't knowingly collect information from anyone under 18.</p>

<h2>Changes</h2>
<p>We'll post any changes to this policy here and update the date at the top. Significant changes will be emailed to customers.</p>

<h2>Contact</h2>
<p>@store.LegalName · @store.ContactEmail</p>
